1 REM FBCS ARR-0353
2 REM CLAIM A-7.1.4-TR135
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 7.1.4 l.3056-3057: reaching a DIM again has no further effect, so the array keeps what was assigned.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
20 CALL E
30 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
110 HANDLER H
120 DIM B(2)
130 LET B(2) = 5
140 END HANDLER
150 LET B(1) = 7
160 WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
170 CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
180 END WHEN
190 PRINT B(1); B(2)
200 END SUB
